id: pm-slack-5fb5
title: Measure all authored source and internal declarations before release approval
description: "Current coverage-gate sources=[.] silently skips scripts by DEFAULT_SKIP_DIRS and certifies only index.ts. It reports lines/branches/functions but has no independent statement metric. Docstring analyzer reports 7 files and 51 selected declarations, without proving all internal declarations. This is a release blocker under the complete-source quality mandate and follows the narrower completed pm-slack-hn3n work."
