acceptance_criteria: Every authored executable TypeScript file including scripts is enumerated in per-file coverage; Statements branches functions and lines are actually measured and all reach 100 percent; Documentation denominator includes all internal documentable declarations and modules; Applicable lint duplication pm-lint security and platform gates run fail-closed locally and in CI with deliberately broken fixtures
risk: high
blocked_reason: Current measurement denominator omits operational scripts and independent statements and does not prove full internal documentation
